     Every setting lives here. Change one, run the loader again — the Kaitun
     reads this table at start and nothing else configures it.

     The loop it runs:
        sweep loot containers (Chest / Cabinet / Carriage / Civilian / Sack)
        -> sack fills toward CarryLimit (40 kg)
        -> at SellAt kg, travel to the nearest Smuggler and sell the whole sack
        -> back to the nearest unlooted container, repeat

     Containers restock 300 s after they are emptied, so a full sweep of the
     island comes back around to a fresh set.

     Looting needs Faction = "Rogue". The Kaitun says so and stops if you are
     not a Ronin — it will not change your faction for you.                   ]]

